{"date":"2025-06-14","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_4b3d9f7972f215a7c1a5df894b1a8098","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1749893400,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-06-11","chunk":0,"id":"m_86035d93be325a2f0f9f4af83d64c55c"}}},{"id":"m_bec3b37835448614a276068be37c276d","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1749893437,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_240164cb7b2dc732106f4c7e6b6b4c81","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1749893474,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_10ce8a142b3a4337a3a532c0632f00c6","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1749893511,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_54ddd2db6944633c6318a9c2a8e76207","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1749893548,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7b1600a52b4033095ffae28234add87d","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1749893585,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ea61810857604024b818f56cde44b22d","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1749893622,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_46ee6181b566094e4ae3d684d07bd039","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1749893659,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6b679e16aff09e6b9dc9ef0245d43776","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1749893696,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2b68348bb1eb14d41e1cc360c041afa9","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1749893733,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fb62b03caa1359be7b28394f0136488e","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1749893770,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_f1928f0194c0a6786737c3fb9d53c837","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1749893807,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1b2eb9b1494627b47067fce1db70c4d1","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1749893844,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_60635d6986cac336181b039764a87a2c","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1749893881,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5ee608127c3cd87e02aa04e4f59d7ae5","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1749893918,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f327c9750f018ba26a6396fd8034250f","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1749893955,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_3ec8ef11509d8e104ae026d2354049bf","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1749893992,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9732716b1ca29c03adc6ace5edf1f324","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1749894029,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_543ee49da9a552d15d2c1aaecde6b4b6","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1749894066,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_646476f195f7d5b6973317f22695be7b","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1749894103,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_08a12d037f7422ad0ca7b07cf15786a5","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1749894140,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c626d7b9dfdc5509cf0699458a2ef7a0","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1749894177,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1c19ff36cd5cf5b983eea42ddb2f7dcb","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1749894214,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_25ed955fd73a1fe9d1ce775502828551","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1749894251,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
